Brou for iPhone and iPad
========================

Brou is maintained by Victor Correal and has its own product name and icon.
The original Search attribution and license are retained below.

This companion app reuses and adapts native Swift and JavaScript from Search by
Office Commun (https://github.com/driceroland/Search), MIT-licensed, through
Victor Correal's maintained Mac variant (https://github.com/victorcorreal/search).
The original authors and available history are retained; this is not an
Office Commun distribution.

Current mappings include:
  Resources/JS/dark.js       from Mac DarkPages.swift
  Resources/JS/reader.js     from Mac Reader.swift
  Resources/JS/text-only.js  from Mac ReaderText.swift
  Sources/CloudSync.swift    shared bookmark synchronization added in the variant
  Sources/Forms.swift        adapted form detection/fill from Mac Forms.swift
  Sources/Shield.swift       adapted WebKit content blocker from Mac Shield.swift

Dark Pages, text-only reading and CloudKit/keychain continuity were developed
in the maintained variant. Earlier extension paths in this file described a
previous layout. See Docs/UPSTREAM_INTEGRATION.md for selected upstream fixes
and Brand/README.md for the independent Brou artwork.

